#. ~ Description of monster "giant short-faced bear"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A bear weighing about a ton, standing at literal eyelevel with man, as long "
"as it isn't towering above you on it's long, muscular hind legs.  Has a wide,"
" short snout, giving it's face an almost feline expression.  Its not "
"particularly aggressive, but doesn't tolerate threats to itself or its cubs."
msgstr ""

